# resources_gap_mapper_views: A mapper-ref texture (type 11) and a mapper-ref buffer (type 15) over mapped surface 2, and a pixel-format view of the texture. A mapper texture does not support discard, so its view is a plain serializer texture: 63 and 62 on the view forget it and the next exec makes it again; 60 on it calls its discard, which throws ("Attempting to discard a view resource"), and 60 faults. 63 on the mapper texture forgets it too, and it is made again. 53 on the mapper texture asks needsSync, which reads its guest validity (always YES). 314 takes Resource::get_resource of the mapper texture and the mapper buffer. The mapper buffer listed twice in one exec is prepared twice; the second finds its buffer made.
